<title>USA: Cape Royale UD, Texas, won by Juran &amp; Moody.</title>
<headline>Cape Royale UD, Texas, won by Juran &amp; Moody.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juran &amp; Moody, Inc., said it won $1.695 million of Cape Royale UD, Texas, waterworks and sewer system tax and revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 6.088 percent.</p>
</text>
